OL,3,ARock collapse kills two in Turkey's
OL,4,ACappadocia, local media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least two people have been killed
OL,7,Fand five injured after a rock formation
OL,8,Fcollapsed at a tourist site in Turkey's
OL,9,Fhistorical region of Cappadocia, local
OL,10,Fmedia is reporting.
OL,12,FOne of the rock spires, which are known
OL,13,Fas fairy chimneys, reportedly
OL,14,Fdisintegrated at the popular open-air
OL,15,Fmuseum in the central town of Goreme.
OL,17,FNevE_ehir provincial Governor Huseyin
OL,18,FKok said the victims' bodies had been
OL,19,Frecovered from under the rubble, but
OL,20,Fthe justice minister warned there could
OL,21,Fbe "other potential victims" still
OL,22,Ftrapped.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
