OL,3,ARock collapse kills two in Turkey's
OL,4,ACappadocia, local media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cause of Thursday's incident was
OL,7,Fnot immediately known, however local
OL,8,Fmedia reported the collapse could have
OL,9,Fbeen triggered by heavy rain.
